# Findings: Instagram Intelligence System

**Last Updated**: 2026-06-04 08:50

---

## System Architecture Discoveries

### Current State (Verified)
- **WORLDWIDEBRO-OS** has 15-folder template for ventures (01_STRATEGY → 15_PEOPLE_OPERATIONS)
- **LightRAG + Supabase** already synced (17 entities, 3 relationships, semantic search live)
- **Obsidian** vault exists but sparse (only 1 file: ventures-hierarchy.md)
- **SocratiCode** indexing 18 repos with codebase graph (13 capabilities extracted)
- **Agents** deployed: HRMS (payroll), support, product agents running daily
- **n8n** workflows exist in `07_AUTOMATIONS/n8n/` but no Instagram connector wired
- **Composio** installed (agents use it), but Instagram connector not activated

### The Missing Piece
- **00_INTAKE_LAYER**: Does NOT exist (root cause of gap)
  - No Instagram folder structure
  - No screenshot storage (ad-hoc capture only)
  - No DM conversation logs
  - No OCR pipeline
  - No extraction agents wired to social input

### What CAN Be Reused
- `07_AUTOMATIONS/Scripts/` already has Python agent scripts (50+ files)
- `AGENT-SYSTEM-PROMPTS.md` provides extraction prompt templates
- Supabase schema ready for new tables
- LightRAG embeddings can handle new content immediately
- Slack integration already configured

---

## Technical Decisions

### Option 1: Python Stack
- **OCR**: Claude Vision API (better for captions + image understanding)
- **Extraction**: Structured output JSON schema
- **Dedup**: Query Supabase via LightRAG semantic search
- **Storage**: Atomic notes in Obsidian
- **Push**: Direct Supabase INSERT via Python SDK

### Option 2: Automation Stack
- **Trigger**: Composio Instagram API (hourly poll)
- **Orchestration**: n8n (visual workflow)
- **Processing**: Call Option 1 extraction script
- **Dashboard**: Obsidian Dataview query
- **Alerts**: Slack webhook on high-signal ideas

### Option 3: Agent Stack
- **Ingestion**: Multi-source API clients (Telegram, Discord, X)
- **Agent Prompt**: Extract people + opportunities + deal flow
- **Graph Building**: Supabase people + relationships tables
- **Visualization**: Obsidian dashboard with network graph
- **Decision Loop**: "Is this real?" filter using existing agent logic

---

## Data Schema (Proposed)

### instagram_ideas Table
Fields: id (uuid), source (varchar), source_url (varchar), screenshot_path (varchar), idea_text (text), category (enum), extracted_by (varchar), people_mentioned (array), tools_mentioned (array), monetization_angle (text), confidence (float 0-1), lightrag_embedding (vector), created_at (timestamp), updated_at (timestamp), obsidian_note_id (varchar)

### people Table (DM Network)
Fields: id (uuid), name (varchar), source (enum: instagram|telegram|discord|x), mention_count (integer), deal_flow_notes (text), network_degree (integer), created_at (timestamp)

### relationships Table
Fields: id (uuid), person_a_id (uuid FK), person_b_id (uuid FK), relationship_type (enum: knows|deal_with|mentioned_opportunity|competitor|partner), confidence (float 0-1), evidence (text), created_at (timestamp)

---

## Integration Points

| System | How It Connects |
|--------|-----------------|
| Obsidian | Atomic notes pushed from Python script; Dataview queries on `source: instagram` |
| LightRAG | Embeddings indexed automatically; semantic search works out-of-box |
| Slack | Webhook post on new ideas; alerts on network changes |
| Existing Agents | Ideas tagged by venture type; routed to relevant agents |
| 07_AUTOMATIONS | Can query `instagram_ideas` table as input data source |
| SocratiCode | Can ingest people + tools extracted from Instagram |

---

## Risks & Mitigations

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|-----------|
| Instagram API rate limits | Hourly polling (not real-time); cache responses |
| OCR hallucination | Confidence threshold + manual review flag |
| Duplicate ideas | LightRAG semantic dedup with tuned threshold |
| DM privacy/consent | Document in README.md; only own accounts |
| Note collision in Obsidian | UUID-based filenames; metadata dedup check |

---

## Success Metrics

- Option 1: Process 10 screenshots in <2 min; zero dedupe false-positives
- Option 2: n8n workflow 99.9% uptime; <5 min latency from post to Obsidian
- Option 3: Network graph with 50+ nodes; degree centrality identifies key people
- Overall: 50+ new ideas captured week 1; 5+ routed to venture agents

